WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.036
-Welcome back to "Late Night."
We're here with

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.071
John Early and Aidy Bryant.
And we were talking backstage.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.573
You said you guys were
very close in real life,

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.009
and maybe we could have you
out here together.

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:12.845
So we made it work and --
-Yeah, it feels amazing.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:15.581
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:17.851
-Just being out here together
feels amazing?

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.251
-Being out --
-Yeah.

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:21.554
-Being out here together for
once, not having to hide it.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.957
-Yeah.
No, it's true,

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.357
because a lot of people
get talking,

00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:27.193
and they don't know
what's going on with us.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.162
-Exactly, and here's my thing.
Ignore the press, you guys.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:32.565
-Yeah.
-Ignore the press.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.300
That's all lies.
Like, what we have --

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.902
-Here's what we want to say --
we're dating.

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:40.406
-Okay.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:43.543
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.913
-I was just...
I feel like, again...

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:50.984
-I'm crazy about you.
-Ugh, that's so crazy

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.751
that you said that,
'cause I'm crazy about you.

00:00:52.751 --> 00:00:55.155
-Yeah.
-Do you like this?

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.057
-I was just bumping right up
against things

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.959
you've talked about
in your individual segments.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.561
Like, you talked about driving
cross-country with your husband.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.730
-No, get comfortable,
get comfortable.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.465
-Thank you, baby.
-Yeah, yeah. Oh, my God.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.569
What can I do to help maximize
your comfort?

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:15.508
-This is the thing, is that,
yes, I'm married or whatever.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.110
-[ Spits ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.846
-But that's
the thing that's hot.

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:22.348
-Right.
-They fight over me.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.949
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:25.819
-Hey, Seth.
-Yup?

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.954
-You want to watch sometime?

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.189
[ Cheers and laughter ]

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:34.260
-I'm about halfway there.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.163
-I'm cresting.
-C-Cresting?

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.331
Do you want...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.331 --> 00:01:41.100
-Seth --
-So, you guys, um --

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.802
Well, let me ask
about some of the rumors.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.170
-Yeah, please.
-Yeah.

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.508
-Is it true that you -- I know
you recently released a single.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:51.144
-Uh-oh.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:53.580
-Why not?

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.716
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.284
-Zoom in?

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.354
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:03.489
-You dropped a new --
You dropped a new single,

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.591
and a lot of people...
-Yeah.

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:08.260
-...they think that this is
a song about you and Aidy.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.429
Could you confirm now
that the new song is...

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:14.000
-Uh, I won't confirm or deny.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.003
but at the same time, I will
very much confirm, yeah.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.471
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.839
-This song --
-It is about my --

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.774
-The song is called

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.944
"[Bleep] It, Suck It,
Might We Gonna Buck It."

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.013
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.948
And it's about me.
-It's so beautiful.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.050
it's a way more beautiful song

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.851
than the title
leads one to believe.

00:02:32.851 --> 00:02:35.955
-Yeah, yeah, it's gorgeous.
-No, it's so good.

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:39.158
-Y'all should play it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:41.728
-Baby, they wish
they could play it like you.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:45.298
Y'all wish you could play it
like he could.

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.834
8G Band, get real.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.235
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.237
-I'm gonna ask you not to be
aggressive with the band.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:55.208
-[Bleep] you, [Bleep].
-I gave you this time!

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:58.377
I gave -- What are you doing?!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:01.681
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:04.249 --> 00:03:05.985
'Cause I am really...

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:08.954
What are you --
Who are you angry with?

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:11.323
-I'm really pissed off
in general!

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:14.427
-Babe, don't! Don't!

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:17.130
Don't do this!
Not in front of my friends!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.997
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.997 --> 00:03:21.434
I'm going crazy, Seth.

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.968
-It's okay.

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:25.037
-[Crying] I feel sick.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:25.037 --> 00:03:26.672
-Will someone
get her something?!

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:27.873
-What do you want?!

00:03:27.873 --> 00:03:30.076
-I need, like,
a cake or something!

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:33.979
-We can't get you a cake.
-I bet you could.

00:03:33.979 --> 00:03:36.916
-Do you want a water? What?
-You're one of the richest guys.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.217
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.486
-That's what we love about you.
-Alright, enough.

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:43.656
Alright, you guys make up.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:47.593
That's John Early
and Aidy Bryant.

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:50.162
[ Cheers and applause ]
They're a big-time couple.

00:03:50.162 --> 00:03:52.064
-Get involved.

00:03:52.064 --> 00:03:53.599
-We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:54.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

